      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My experience with M Lia Electrics has been excellent from initial appointment, quoting, efficient installation and service to after care.Michael took the time to engage in phone conversations and explain the process and answer all my questions. Then he promptly came to my property to do the assessment and measurement to recommend best options for solar systems.Quoting was done greatly too, where M Lia electrics send numerous quotes 5-10 for different systems and inverters so that I can make the best informed decision looking at factors like value for money, quality and size.Installation was very quick and efficient and on time given the wet weather we had at the time.Michael has always been polite, knowledgeable and punctual throughout process and provided after sales care also.I would highly recommend M Lia Ekectrical.",
