      "review_date": "2023-03-05",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I first looked into installing a solar system at my home a few years ago and I had a few concerns.1 After a detailed costing process I didn’t think it was financial buyable.2 Concerns with the appearance of the solar panels on my roof (the front of my property faces north) so all visitors would clearly see the panels.3 Concerns with the visibility of the rooftop DC isolators.Recently I revisited the whole going solar thing I wanted a system that would be installed where it was as pleasing to the eye as possible. I obtained two quotes and selected M Lia Electrics Pty Ltd. I felt comfortable dealing with the electrical installer Michael rather than a salesman. He detailed all the steps of the installation and the whole process. He stated that DC rooftop isolators are no longer required and with the new panels being 415 watts I only required 16 in total. Michael although a young feller has exceptional attention to detail. One of my original worries was the quality of installations that I've observed in my  local area. Ok they may meet standard but there's a lot to be said on the overall appearance. To support this Michael feed cabling from the meter box and inverter through the wall cavity so it looks as clean as possible. It really was pleasing so see someone take pride in what he or she does. With the assistance from Vanessa who processes all the paper work it really was a super easy experience and would highly recommend M M Lia Electrics Pty Ltd.",
